# PROJECT NAME: TRAVELMATE
## Full-Stack Travel, Tourism, Tour Guide, Hotel & Vehicle Rental Platform

Act as an expert full-stack software developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and software engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, modern, responsive, and fully functional full-stack travel and tourism website named **TravelMate**.

TravelMate is a multi-vendor travel and tourism marketplace primarily focused on Pakistan, especially Gilgit-Baltistan, Hunza, Skardu, Gilgit, Naran, Kaghan, Murree, Swat, and other popular tourist destinations.

The platform connects four major types of users:

1. Tour Guides
2. Tourists / Travellers
3. Hotel Owners
4. Car Rental / Vehicle Owners

The platform must allow tourists to plan trips, hire verified tour guides, book tour packages, reserve hotels independently, and rent vehicles for a selected number of days.

IMPORTANT PAYMENT REQUIREMENT:

Online payments are NOT being implemented in the current version. Keep all online payment functionality disabled.

Whenever a user clicks any online payment button, display a professional notification or modal:

"Online Payments Coming Soon! We are working on secure online payments. You can continue with your booking request and our team will update you when online payments become available."

Do not redirect users to a payment gateway. Do not collect card details or pretend that payments have been processed.

Booking requests and booking management must work independently of online payments.

